DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTSTAMP:20261009T171750Z
UID:7d76d5286e75cc8458cf866047eb@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join Seaside Shadows for a spirited night out with our Paranor
 mal Pub Crawl—a thrilling “just a beer” ghost tour through Mystic’
 s most haunted and historic taverns! On the second Friday of every month\,
  March through August\, or first Friday of every month\, September through
  December sip and shiver as you enjoy three beers included with your ticke
 t while uncovering eerie tales of the supernatural.\n\nSource: https://ctv
 isit.com/events/paranormal-pub-crawl-1
LOCATION:Bank Square\, Water Street\, West Main Street\, Mystic CT\, 06355
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/paranormal-pub-crawl-1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:America250: THE REAL REVOLUTION
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271202
DTSTAMP:20261009T171750Z
UID:d496508c04ff23629e29f741202e@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A mother with sons on opposing side of a life-changing conflic
 t. Enslaved men risking their lives for freedom. A woman posing as a man i
 n the fight for liberty. These are just a few of the people who are explor
 ed in The Real Revolution\, Westport Museum’s 2026 exhibit honoring the 
 250th anniversary of the founding of the nation. The exhibit delves into t
 he untold stories of the people who lived through the life-changing events
  of war and nation building. The exhibition includes an interactive playro
 om for kids\, and a tavern room in which special events will be held.\n\nS
 ource: https://ctvisit.com/events/america250-real-revolution
LOCATION:Westport Museum For History And Culture\, 25 Avery Place\, Westpo
 rt CT\, 06880
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/america250-real-revolution
END:VEVENT
