DESCRIPTION:Relax and let the soothing sounds of live gongs and singing bo
 wls wash over you for meditative bliss. Immersed in live soothing vibratio
 ns - this is the perfect setting to release any negative energy\, and conn
 ect with your calm and balance within. We are so very excited to perform a
 t this beautiful community space. West Hartford Yoga has been hosting us f
 or almost 15 years and we're so very grateful to continue our series of me
 ditations in this warm and inviting studio space\n\nSource: https://ctvisi
 t.com/events/sound-meditation-concert-why-5
