BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hauntings and History at Hoyt-Barnum
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTSTAMP:20261009T171750Z
UID:f325a0c7913950827501a0afc848@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Hauntings and History at Hoyt-Barnum is back the night before 
 Halloween! The Stamford History Center hosts this annual event in Stamford
 ’s oldest dwelling\, the Hoyt-Barnum House. Emily Freidberg\, Education 
 Coordinator of Stamford History Center will be your host\, taking you into
  a day in the life of a colonist. This interactive tour highlights the har
 dships of Colonial life and includes spooky stories\, such as the tale of 
 Stamford's witch\, Elizabeth Clawson.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/event
 s/hauntings-and-history-hoyt-barnum-1
LOCATION:Stamford History Center\, 1508 High Ridge Rd.\, Stamford CT\, 069
 03
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/hauntings-and-history-hoyt-barnum-1
END:VEVENT
